{'symbol': 'FSLR', 'date': '2021-04-01 09:05:00', 'title': 'FIRST SOLAR COMPLETES SALE OF US DEVELOPMENT PLATFORM TO LEEWARD', 'text': 'DALLAS AND TEMPE, ARIZ., APRIL 01, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- FIRST SOLAR, INC. (NASDAQ: FSLR), ANNOUNCED THAT IT COMPLETED THE PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED SALE OF A UTILITY-SCALE SOLAR PROJECT PLATFORM OF APPROXIMATELY 10 GIGAWATTS (GW)AC TO LEEWARD RENEWABLE ENERGY, LLC (“LEEWARD”), YESTERDAY.'}